<title>TURKEY: Turkish shares fall 1,87 percent on high rates.</title>
<headline>Turkish shares fall 1,87 percent on high rates.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Istanbul stock exchange index continued its downward trend for the second day on Friday over rising interest rates and expectations for high inflation, brokers say.</p>
<p>The IMKB National-100  .XU100 ended down 36 points, or 1.87 percent at 1,889 at close. SY</p>
</text>
